WEBVTT

NOTE Acme Robotics — discovery call

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.500
<v Dana Whitfield>Thanks for making the time. Tell me how reporting works today.</v>

2
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:06.200
<v Priya Raman>Exporting the weekly report takes us most of Friday afternoon.</v>

3
00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:12.000
<v Priya Raman>It's four spreadsheets, pasted together by hand, and someone always fat-fingers a column.</v>

4
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.500
<v Dana Whitfield>Who ends up doing that?</v>

5
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:24.000
<v Priya Raman>Usually me, or Tom when I'm out. We would love to just get it in Slack automatically on Monday morning.</v>

6
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:09.000
<v Priya Raman>Our warehouse team mostly works nights, so the timing matters.</v>
